# cmd/smoke artifacts — the identity file is a CREDENTIAL (an Ed25519 private key
# bound to a real install), and the wav is a paid artifact. Neither belongs in git.
# cmd/smoke 的产物——身份文件是**凭据**(一把绑定真实 install 的 Ed25519 私钥),wav 是花钱买来的
# 产物。两者都不该进 git。
smoke-identity.json
smoke-speech.wav
